      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Redcliffe%2C_Queensland"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A railway line opened in 2016 linking Caboolture to Kippa‑Ring, making Redcliffe the northern terminus of the Moreton Bay rail network.",
